                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608052319217481.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608052319217481_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608052319217481_720.jpg"> </div><p>【转会新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a7364b6e3551native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">尘埃落定！TA：皇马签19岁迪奥曼德达协议！总价最高可达1.4亿欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060031481257.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060031481257_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060031481257_720.jpg"> </div><p>The Athletic消息，皇马就迪奥曼德的转会与莱比锡达成协议，转会费1.25亿欧，外加1500万欧浮动条款！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a735320a9254native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">2400万年薪续约？天空：在与皇马高层谈判后，维尼修斯仍预计留队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260625/6a3c6097188fb_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260625/6a3c6097188fb.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260625/6a3c6097188fb.jpg"> </div><p>天空体育报道，在与皇马高层谈判后，维尼修斯仍预计留队。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a736f6ecbdb9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">DO：皇马提高对维尼修斯续约报价，新报价能体现其对球队重要性</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a736e8a109cbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：皇马与维尼修斯会面进展非常积极，俱乐部希望其尽快答复</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251221/6947270b87741.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251221/6947270b87741.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251221/6947270b87741.jpg"> </div><p>The Athletic、罗马诺同时发布消息，皇马提高了对维尼修斯的续约报价，现在取决于球员选择。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a737543d52e9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：维尼修斯接近与皇马续约 迪奥曼德官宣很快到来</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250920/68ce716c63eb5.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250920/68ce716c63eb5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250920/68ce716c63eb5.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺更新视频表示，维尼修斯接近续约，而迪奥曼德已经进入官宣倒计时。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a737d4cc7fffnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">这是何意？维尼修斯清空了自己社媒账号所有帖子和个人简介</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060213434772.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060213434772_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060213434772_720.jpg"> </div><p>尽管最新一批报道，都透露维尼修斯与皇马谈判顺利，皇马有信心续约。但蹊跷之处是，维尼修斯忽然清空了个人社媒，连头像也变成了空白。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a73a5a049b4anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：埃弗顿签下阿森纳中场诺尔高 转会费700万镑签约2年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060506057252.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060506057252.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060506057252.jpg"> </div><p>埃弗顿官方宣布，从阿森纳签下丹麦中场诺尔高，签约至2028年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a73aae15f1cenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">只待官宣！罗马诺：吉马良斯已经通过阿森纳体检，即将签约四年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060528168745.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060528168745_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060528168745_720.jpg"> </div><p>在here we go确认达协议后，记者罗马诺最新消息确认，吉马良斯已经通过阿森纳体检，即将与阿森纳正式签下一份四年合同。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a7384c39c267native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：小蜘蛛将当面告知马竞他只想效力巴萨，但预计他不会罢训</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d4ee3e18b1_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d4ee3e18b1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260708/6a4d4ee3e18b1.jpg"> </div><p>ESPN阿根廷消息，阿尔瓦雷斯将在周一当面告知马竞他不想再为马竞踢球，他只想加盟巴萨，不过他不会采取极端手段。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a7356504b06dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">特拉布宗体育官方：8月7日零点30分为萨拉赫举行签约仪式</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260805/202608052337265353.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260805/202608052337265353.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260805/202608052337265353.jpg"> </div><p>土超俱乐部特拉布宗体育发布公告，将于当地时间8月6日19点半（北京时间8月7日凌晨零点30分）为新援萨拉赫举行签约仪式。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a73bb2466ac8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">科贝记者：马竞不会将阿尔瓦雷斯出售给巴萨，无论价格如何</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260409/69d769d6bbb93.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG