%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060203396187_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060203396187_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，雅伊斯勒出任纽卡斯尔新任主帅，接替此前离开的埃迪·豪。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a73a1ce60388native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：吉马良斯已通过体检和阿森纳签约，7500万镑分期3年支付</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.6" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060450198612.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.6" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.6" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060450198612_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260806/202608060450198612_720.jpg"> </div><p>记者Casagrande消息，吉马良斯已完成体检，和阿森纳签约。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-06/6a735f12db62cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：罗马签马竞右后卫莫利纳达成协议，总价1800万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260806/202608060012359948.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="back